# 🚛 Fleet Safety & Driver Behaviour Analytics Dashboard

Operational analytics project focused on monitoring fleet incidents, driver behaviour trends, and safety risk exposure using Excel dashboards and business intelligence reporting.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project was developed to support fleet operations management by providing visibility into driver behaviour, incident trends, and high-risk operational patterns.

The dashboard enables management to:

- Monitor monthly fleet incidents
- Identify high-risk trucks/drivers
- Analyze behavioural safety trends
- Support incident reduction initiatives
- Improve operational safety decision-making

---

## 📌 Business Problem

Fleet incidents and unsafe driving behaviours were increasing across monitored vehicles, creating operational and safety risks.

Management required a centralized reporting solution to:

- Track incident trends monthly
- Identify recurring risk behaviours
- Monitor high-risk vehicles
- Support targeted driver intervention
- Improve fleet safety visibility

---

## 📌 Project Objectives

- Analyze Month-on-Month (MoM) incident trends
- Monitor driver behaviour patterns
- Identify top risk trucks/drivers
- Support operational safety interventions
- Develop executive-level reporting dashboards

---

## 📌 Tools & Skills Used

### Tools
