---

## 📌 Dashboard Features

### Executive KPIs
- Total Incidents
- Incident per Truck
- Monthly Incident Change (%)
- High-Risk Trucks

### Analysis Sections
- Monthly Incident Trend
- Top Risk Trucks
- Top Incident Categories
- Behavioural Risk Monitoring
- Operational Recommendations

---

## 📌 Dashboard Preview

### Main Dashboard

![Dashboard](Dashboard Screenshot.png)

---

## 📌 Key Insights (April Example)

- Total incidents reduced to 1,927 (-13% MoM)
- Incident levels improved following March spike
- Risk remained concentrated among a few trucks
- Seat Belt, Camera Block, and Forward Collision alerts remained the top incident categories
- Continuous monitoring and driver coaching remain critical

---

## 📌 Recommendations

- Prioritize intervention for high-risk trucks
- Reinforce seat belt and safety compliance
- Strengthen driver coaching initiatives
- Maintain weekly monitoring and monthly reporting
- Escalate repeat high-risk behaviour

---

## 📌 Business Impact

The dashboard improved visibility into fleet risk exposure and enabled data-driven safety monitoring, helping management identify recurring operational risks and prioritize targeted interventions.

